From 7c84f248708245317eee49331869411a0892c0b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caca2331 <spurtcarl@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:08:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] feat(whisper): run the encoder self-attention with
 flash attention

Whisper's flash_attention option reached only the decoder: WhisperEncoder
built its layers without it, while WhisperDecoder inherited
TransformerDecoder's reading of model.use_flash_attention() and swapped its
self-attention (and its cache layout) for FlashMultiHeadAttention. The cost
it targets is the encoder's self-attention over 1500 frames.

Pass the option to the encoder layers and keep the decoder on the standard
attention, so turning it on changes the encoder only. FlashMultiHeadAttention
also built its op with the default is_causal=true whatever the layer, which
in an encoder masks each frame to the frames before it; make it causal only
in a decoder. Also expose flash_attention_available(), whether the build
has WITH_FLASH_ATTN: a build without it accepts the option and fails only
at the first encode.
